      "writtenOn": "2021-10-04T22:08:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m trying to test it, and I got the following build error:\n\n    llvm-strip: error: Link field value 48 in section .rela.text is not a symbol table\n    make[2]: *** [p21-kernel/private/gs-google/scripts/Makefile.modinst:33: crypto/fips140.ko] Error 1\n\nAny idea what the problem is?",
      "parentUuid": "438e5801_c6a90d1c",
