      "writtenOn": "2021-10-07T00:23:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "PS4 switched to a new approach where copies of the relocation sections are made, which avoids the llvm-strip bug.  The module is successfully building and loading for me now.",
      "parentUuid": "610d4a02_666bcc8b",
      "revId": "adc65f2e5153825701923ade551127ac86ca27e6",
